@startuml
|Lecturer|
start
:Request list of project proposals;

|ProposalManagementInterface|
:Display list of project proposals;

|ProposalController|
:Retrieve project proposals;

|ProposalService|
:Fetch project proposals from storage;

|ProposalService|
:Return list of project proposals;

|ProposalManagementInterface|
:Display project proposals to Lecturer;

:View proposal details;

|ProposalController|
:Retrieve specific proposal details;

|ProposalService|
:Fetch proposal details from storage;

|ProposalService|
:Return detailed proposal information;

|ProposalManagementInterface|
:Display detailed proposal information;

:Approve or reject proposal;

|ProposalController|
:Process approval or rejection of proposal;

|ProposalService|
:Update proposal status in storage;

if (Approval successful?) then (yes)
    :Notify student of approval;

    |NotificationService|
    :Send approval notification to student;

    |NotificationService|
    :Confirm notification sent;
else (Rejection)
    :Notify student of rejection;

    |NotificationService|
    :Send rejection notification to student;

    |NotificationService|
    :Confirm notification sent;
endif

|ProposalService|
:Return approval/rejection status;

|ProposalController|
:Update proposal management status;

|ProposalManagementInterface|
:Display final proposal management status;
stop
@enduml